### Create invalid investor
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorData": {
    "username": "test8",
    "email": "bob@gmail.com",
    "firstname": "Bob",
    "lastname": "Eponge",
    "birthday": "2000-01-01"
  },
  "password": "Patrick"
}

### Create investor
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorData": {
    "username": "testUser",
    "email": "bob@gmail.com",
    "firstname": "Bob",
    "lastname": "Eponge",
    "birthday": "2000-01-01"
  },
  "password": "Patrick"
}

### Create existing investor
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorData": {
    "username": "testUser",
    "email": "bob@gmail.com",
    "firstname": "Bob",
    "lastname": "Eponge",
    "birthday": "2000-01-01"
  },
  "password": "Patrick"
}

### Connect user
POST http://localhost:8080/authentication/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testUser",
  "password": "Patrick"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body)
%}

### Read their own information
GET http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Authorization: {{token}}

### Read information while not being connected
GET http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Authorization: ''

### Read another investor's information
GET http://localhost:8080/investor/test
Authorization: {{token}}

### Update their own information
PUT http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testUser",
  "email": "bob.eponge@gmail.com",
  "firstname": "Boby",
  "lastname": "Eponge",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}

### Update another investor's information
PUT http://localhost:8080/investor/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "email": "bob.eponge@gmail.com",
  "firstname": "Boby",
  "lastname": "Eponge",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}

### Create investor to test delete
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/test11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorData": {
    "username": "test11",
    "email": "bob@gmail.com",
    "firstname": "Bob",
    "lastname": "Eponge",
    "birthday": "2000-01-01"
  },
  "password": "Patrick"
}

### Delete an investor
DELETE http://localhost:8080/investor/test11

### Delete non existing investor
DELETE http://localhost:8080/investor/test220

### Add cash to testUser wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/wallet/testUser/cash
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cash": 100.0
}

### Read Net worth value of testUser wallet
GET http://localhost:8080/wallet/testUser/net-worth
Authorization: {{token}}

### Delete an investor but the investor's situation does not allow (test with wallet)
DELETE http://localhost:9001/investor/testUser

