### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/testUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "testUser",
  "timestamp": 123446599789,
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 10,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "limit": 100.0,
  "filled": 0
}

### Read all orders of an existing user
GET http://localhost:8080/order/by-user/testUser
Authorization: {{token}}

### Read all orders of another investor while being connected as testUser
GET http://localhost:8080/order/by-user/test9
Authorization: {{token}}

### Read all open positions of an investor
GET http://localhost:8080/wallet/testUser
Authorization: {{token}}

### Read all open positions of another investor while being connected as testUser
GET http://localhost:8080/wallet/test9
Authorization: {{token}}

### Read all open positions of another investor while being connected as testUser
GET http://localhost:8080/wallet/test9
Authorization: {{token}}

### Add 10 quantity of the ticker 'AZERTY' in testUser
POST http://localhost:8080/wallet/testUser/position/XYZ
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10.0
}

### Read price of AZERTY
GET http://localhost:8080/price/XYZ




